They are nonzero: a zero would require `(2m+j)^2=12m`, while `(2m+2)^2>12m` for m >= 2. The eta-dependent forcing has degree at most m+2 <= 2m and is absent from these rows. The B-dependent forcing has degree at most 2m+1; induction shows that the reconstructed P_j for j >= 2 are also B-independent. Set `eta=P2`, prescribe `P1=-B`, `P0=-b^2/4`, and solve row 2m+1 for B. Its constant pivot is

