+All retained files are small proof notes, drivers, and compact transcripts. No new exit-price assertion is made; consequently no charge_basis line applies. The report's uniform claims are the proved restricted statements in §§3–5 and the b=B=0 classification in §7. The unrestricted classification, U_eta, and the explicitly displayed (B-UF) exclusion are **OPEN**.
